  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Expert dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;&#x10d;ka na budovanie kapac&#xed;t a posilnenie spolupr&#xe1;ce IKT sektorov medzi Slovenskom a Ukrajinou, s d&#xf4;razom na &#x17e;eny v IKT</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expert volunteer to build capacity and strengthen cooperation of ICT sectors between Slovakia and Ukraine, with an emphasis on women in ICT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Projekt, na ktorom bude expertn&#xe1; dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;&#x10d;ka participova&#x165; posil&#x148;uje kvalitn&#xe9; vzdel&#xe1;vanie zodpovedn&#xe9; potreb&#xe1;m IKT sektora na Ukrajine. Prostredn&#xed;ctvom Akad&#xe9;mie kybernetickej bezpe&#x10d;nosti projekt rozv&#xed;ja m&#xe4;kk&#xe9; a tvrd&#xe9; zru&#x10d;nost&#xed; &#x161;tudentov a &#x161;tudentiek, pri&#x10d;om najlep&#x161;&#xed;m 5 &#x161;tudentk&#xe1;m poskytne st&#xe1;&#x17e; na Slovensku.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, in which the expert volunteer will participate, supports long-term partnerships between the educational and private ICT sectors for the support of quality in line with the market needs. Through the Cyber Security Academy, the project develops the soft and hard skills of male and female students, while providing top 5 female students with an internship in Slovakia.</narrative>
  </description>
